guide polestar-experimental/hyjal-3
title Mount Hyjal 3: the Shrine of Aviana, Dae'gun and the Summit of Eternity (experimental)
levels 57-59
zone Mount Hyjal
coords live
folder Mount Hyjal · Experimental
why Forever's new endgame zone, an alpha route from Forever's quest data and the first recording of the zone.
keywords mount hyjal, hyjal, shrine of aviana, dae'gun, summit of eternity, nordrassil, experimental, alpha
next forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands when level<58
next forever/alliance/50-60/05-silithus when level>=58
next forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus when level<59
next forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood when level>=59

# Polestar Experimental, Mount Hyjal part 3 of 3, for both factions (2026-11-12). Hand-written.
# Sources as in parts 1 and 2: Forever's quest data for quests, givers, enders and objectives; the one recorded
# session (an Alliance player, levels 57 to 60) for the order, the spots and the chain links the data lacks.
# Order: the Shrine of Aviana and its harpies, back south-west past the Deadwood camps to Barkskin Burrow for its
# three hand-ins, north-east through the Cradle to Johun (Alliance) and Dae'gun (Renalard first, then the demon
# camps west to east and back), the Summit of Eternity (flight path, inn), a flight down for Kaylaena and Ketharas,
# then the Summit's Blackthorne camps in one sweep, and out by Everlook.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (the recording; one player, so leads to confirm): A Bit of the
# Sky after Taking to New Heights; Avalanche of Corruption after Resupply; Drawing Down the Malevolent after
# Siphoned Ephemeral Essence; As the Crow Flies after Drawing Down the Malevolent; Ashes of the Legion Ascent and
# To Outfox a Demon after A Clever Creature; Siegecraft after Rubble Rummage; The Staff of the Mountain after
# Stolen Life, Ashes of the Legion Ascent and A Bit of the Sky; Paying Back the Pact after The Staff of the
# Mountain.
# Not checked to the end in the recording (taken, not finished, or not taken): the Summit's Blackthorne quests
# (Cult Closure, Twisted Tools, A Thorn in the Paw, Paying Back the Pact), Cleansing Winds and Maerion's Misery.
# Maerion's Felhound Spikes: one in about ten Defiling Hounds dropped one after the recorded player took the
# quest (1 spike from 11 kills), so its collection and hand-in are optional. The Shrine's Spear of the Skylord,
# Highfeather Helper and Tarnished Treasures were offered before Taking to New Heights and Past Wing and Claw were
# handed in (the windows in the recording): the breadcrumbs do not gate them.
# Left out on purpose:
# - Yashiro's Windwalk (96983): its Doomguard Xarkul is an elite (level 61); the recorded player dropped it.
# - Gathering Storm (96494) and A Shaw Deal (96529): the first sends you to the Summit's far end and back to
#   Johun, the second to Stormwind.
# - Blind Vengeance (97010), the Summit's level 60 chain after Paying Back the Pact (Ve'han's Fall 92833 with an
#   elite, Summit Sentries 93127, A Thorny Solution 93547, Challenger of the Gods 93521, Work Well Done 93848,
#   Return to Jereman 99670), Marn's and Thisalee's Well of Eternity quests (92016, 96301, 96302, 96303),
#   Blackthorne Blackout (93422, an elite courier), Drum Up Trouble (92329) and Bait the Beast (93444, both with
#   Ghansurok, an elite chimaera): not recorded yet.
# - The Horde's Tribal Colors (96998) and Wrap Return (96999): the remains lie in Dae'gun and the hand-ins are in
#   Elderwild and Sen'jin Village.

step Back to Mount Hyjal
  when !zone "Mount Hyjal"
  tip Experimental route (alpha). It is written from Forever's quest data and the first recording of the zone, and some steps are not checked in game yet: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip This part carries on from part 2 in the Cradle of Tranquility: fly to the Tainted Foothills and ride north-west, or ride in from Everlook through Darkwhisper Gorge.
  fly "Tainted Foothills"
  zone Mount Hyjal

step Corrupted Growth
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip East from the Cradle towards the Shrine of Aviana, where the Wormwing harpies nest: a corrupted growth on the shrine's western slope starts a quest for Phoebe.
  accept 96296                          -- Fetid Corruption

step Skylord Omnuron
  when onquest 92171
  tip Skylord Omnuron and Phoebe Highfeather stand together at the Shrine of Aviana.
  turnin 92171                          -- Skylord Omnuron
  accept 92500                          -- A Bit of the Sky: for Ketharas, later in this guide

step Phoebe Highfeather
  when onquest 96145
  turnin 96145

step The Shrine of Aviana
  accept 91883                          -- Skylord Omnuron: Spear of the Skylord
  accept 92147                          -- Phoebe Highfeather: Highfeather Helper
  accept 96252                          -- Tarnished Treasures

step The harpy grounds
  tip The Wormwing harpies nest on the slopes north-west of the shrine. They drop the pinfeathers and Thobon's amulets; the bangles lie in their nests, the Jewel of the Horizon in a nest on the western slope, and Zarrat Wormwing, who has Omnuron's spear, is among them. The corrupted knots grow on the trees just north-west of the shrine.
  collect 268997 x18 quest 92147.1      -- Wormwing Pinfeather
  collect 263028 x16 quest 93827.1      -- Enchanted Harpy Amulet
  collect 273164 x8 quest 96252.1 @53.0,60.4  -- Tarnished Highfeather Bangle
  collect 272974 quest 92500.1 @47.7,59.4  -- The Jewel of the Horizon
  collect 268998 quest 91883.1          -- Omnuron's Spear
  complete 96296 @52.6,60.3             -- remove the corrupted knots

step The Shrine of Aviana
  turnin 91883                          -- Skylord Omnuron
  turnin 92147                          -- Phoebe Highfeather
  turnin 96252
  turnin 96296

step The Deadwood camps
  tip South-west back towards Barkskin Burrow: the Deadwood camps on the slopes east of the burrow hold the Totemics and Fel-Tenders. An elite named Head Scratcher (level 60) may roam the camps' eastern end.
  kill 252116 x8 quest 93826.1          -- Deadwood Totemic
  kill 252096 x8 quest 93826.2          -- Deadwood Fel-Tender

step Barkskin Burrow
  tip Into the burrow for the elders, Suma and Thobon.
  turnin 93826                          -- Elder Pinespeaker
  turnin 93825                          -- Suma Mossmane
  turnin 93827 @20.6,78.8               -- Thobon Sapclaw

step Johun "Punchy" Dillas
  only Alliance
  tip North-east across the Cradle to Johun's camp at the edge of Dae'gun.
  turnin 96992
  accept 92593                          -- Avalanche of Corruption

step Elaena, Witherbeard and Yashiro
  tip North into Dae'gun, the ruins of a Horde base, now held by demons: Elaena Moonwhisper and Witherbeard camp at its western edge; Yashiro, a blademaster, waits a little east of them. Doomguards (elites, levels 58-59) walk among the demons: pull carefully.
  accept 92960                          -- Elaena Moonwhisper: Siphoned Ephemeral Essence
  accept 95793                          -- Witherbeard: Stemming the Demon Tide
  accept 96959                          -- Yashiro: Blademaster's Bonfires

step Renalard
  when onquest 96964
  tip South-east across Dae'gun to Renalard, the wild god, indoors at its south-eastern edge.
  turnin 96964                          -- Renalard
  accept 92335                          -- Ashes of the Legion Ascent: for Ketharas, later in this guide
  accept 96971                          -- To Outfox a Demon

step Dae'gun
  tip Work west back through Dae'gun: the Felguard Sentinels and Defiling Hounds are everywhere, the hounds carry the essence, and the Horde base's rubble (wire, scrap and dung) lies all over it. Light the two bonfires on your way, scout the Horde tower in the middle, and pick up the abandoned supplies and Azgalor's ashes in the western half.
  kill 249229 x12 quest 95793.1         -- Felguard Sentinel
  collect 271220 x6 quest 92960.1       -- Ephemeral Essence
  collect 250775 x5 quest 92011.1 @51.5,37.0  -- Frayed Wire
  collect 269244 x5 quest 92011.2 @62.5,41.5  -- Calcified Excrement
  collect 269246 x5 quest 92011.3 @56.0,41.2  -- Warped Metal Scrap
  goto 54.8,40.0 "Southeast Bonfire"
  goto 49.1,36.1 "South Bonfire"
  complete 92593 @53.7,33.5 only Alliance  -- scout the Horde tower
  collect 275958 x8 quest 96971.1 @50.2,37.0  -- Abandoned Supplies
  collect 253239 quest 92335.1 @49.5,34.6  -- Azgalor's Ashes

