step Bethra'zel and Maerion
  tip North-east to Bethra'zel: use Elaena's eye on him to drain him, then kill him. Doomguard Xarkul, an elite (level 61), walks this corner of Dae'gun: keep out of his way.
  tip Maerion Thaelemaches waits a little further north-east. His Felhound Spikes come from the Defiling Hounds, and in our only recording about one hound in ten had one: kill the hounds around him while you are here, and leave his quest if the twelve spikes are slow to come.
  kill 263394 quest 96003.1             -- Bethra'zel
  accept 97009                          -- Maerion Thaelemaches: Maerion's Misery
  collect 276100 x12 quest 97009.1 optional  -- Felhound Spike
  turnin 97009 optional

step Mazzogore
  tip South-west to Mazzogore the Weak, in the middle of Dae'gun: drain him with the eye too, then kill him.
  kill 252457 quest 96003.2             -- Mazzogore the Weak

step Elaena Moonwhisper
  turnin 96003
  accept 96025                          -- As the Crow Flies: for Thisalee Crow at the Summit

step Renalard
  when onquest 96971
  tip South-east to Renalard.
  turnin 96971

step The Summit of Eternity
  tip East up to the Summit of Eternity, the druids' camp. Fayran Elthas, the flight master, stands at its north end; Marn Euhorn, Toron Rockhoof and Thisalee Crow along the path south; Tiala Whitemane indoors next to Thisalee; Sebelia, the innkeeper, at the south-east end. The Horde's hand-in to Thisalee is not in our recordings yet.
  getfp "Summit of Eternity" @68.7,44.1  -- Fayran Elthas, at the flight point
  turnin 96991                          -- Marn Euhorn
  accept 92017                          -- Cleansing Winds
  accept 92533                          -- Toron Rockhoof: Twisted Tools
  turnin 91688 only Alliance            -- Thisalee Crow
  turnin 95248 only Horde
  turnin 96025
  accept 93584                          -- Cult Closure
  accept 93407                          -- Tiala Whitemane: A Thorn in the Paw
  accept 93197                          -- Sebelia: Mending Communications: for Innkeeper Vizzie in Everlook, at the end
  sethome "Summit of Eternity" npc 243815  -- Sebelia

step Fly to the Tainted Foothills
  tip Fly down to Bluebell for Kaylaena and Ketharas.
  fly "Tainted Foothills"

step Kaylaena's workshop
  tip North to the workshop. Turn the two gears and connect the two battery terminals on both sides of her glaive thrower. Ghansurok, the elite chimaera (level 61), prowls around the workshop: watch for him while you work.
  turnin 92011                          -- Kaylaena Springwhisper
  accept 92328                          -- Siegecraft
  complete 92328 @60.6,61.2
  turnin 92328

