step Tiala Whitemane
  when onquest 90647
  tip Indoors at the Summit, next to Thisalee Crow.
  turnin 90647
  accept 92169                          -- Paying Back the Pact

step The Blackthorne camps
  when onquest 92169
  tip The Blackthorne cultists camp on the slopes north-east of the Summit (level 60, with elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier among them: pull carefully). Ve'han Talongrasp, an elite (level 60) who leads them, stands among them: leave him be. Ghansurok, an elite chimaera (level 61), also roams the ridge north of the camps.
  tip Use Tiala's staff on a Pact member to strip its ward, then kill it, ten times: the Cultists and Adepts you kill this way count for Thisalee too. The Cultists carry the kris and the Adepts the staff; the thorn seeds lie in the woods there, and the hippogryphs and chimaeras roam the slopes all around. Not finished in our recordings yet: if something here is off, tell us.
  complete 92169 @75.9,35.4             -- Paying Back the Pact
  kill 249551 x10 quest 93584.1         -- Blackthorne Cultist
  kill 264570 x10 quest 93584.2         -- Blackthorne Adept
  collect 273832 quest 92533.1          -- Wicked Ritualist's Kris
  collect 273828 quest 92533.2          -- Recoiling Gnarlybark Staff
  collect 263227 x18 quest 93407.1 @74.3,40.2  -- Thorn Seed
  collect 274287 x5 quest 92017.1       -- Grand Hippogryph Feather
  collect 274288 x3 quest 92017.2       -- Oily Chimaera Hair

